From 639adccf546e3d5df9ce7aeb793497e10ea83f1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 01:27:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/51] begonia-wifi (fwport-gen4m): cfg80211_ops 4.14->6.16
 link_id + struct churn

gl_cfg80211.{c,h} + gl_init.c ops table, all guarded by CFG80211_VERSION_CODE
(single-link device: link_id accepted and ignored):
- key ops add/get/del_key, set_default_key, set_default_mgmt_key: +int link_id (6.1)
- tdls_mgmt: +int link_id after peer (6.1)
- start_radar_detection: +int link_id trailing (6.3)
- stop_ap, set_bitrate_mask, get_txpower: +unsigned int link_id (6.0)
- change_beacon: cfg80211_beacon_data* -> cfg80211_ap_update* (deref .beacon) (6.0)
- mgmt_frame_register: removed from cfg80211_ops in 5.8 -> guard the table slot
- netif_napi_add: drop weight arg on 6.1+ (gl_init.c)
- compat stdarg.h shim -> <linux/stdarg.h>
No register value touched; signature/type/header only.

Signed-off-by: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
